{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RCA update: confirmed root cause is deploy-key rotation order, not object-store corruption. Rotation ticket auspicial-wily-warbler records `/rebar/prod/github-replication-deploy-key` version 3 -> 4 and old GitHub deploy key id 155914477 deleted after a single verification. Live evidence shows the file key was rotated/materialized at 2026-09-07T22:41:43Z with fingerprint SHA256:iJ7j98LfAGhV+gz4JpEOuCSDAAZUYR9FPuayfCSwW9c, but Gerrit/JGit replication kept trying stale key SHA256:jBCGL6vjKQfNJQjW9qs43uVpUp7Nfo/2Ygx3kgN7Rmk until Gerrit restart at 2026-09-08T14:03Z. Prevention in progress: TDD RED added tests/scripts/test_gerrit_replication_key_rotation.py (initially failed) proving setup-replication must tell operators to restart/reload before verification and retire the old deploy key only after replication_log confirms the old key is no longer used."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788876695500320001,"uuid":"49f5172b-cf0b-4291-95c3-4770f7e4f54b"}